      "prompt": "Four of you were assigned a presentation. Two did nothing until the last week, then sent a few slides. The deadline is tomorrow. The rubric says all group members receive the same grade. One of the two who did nothing is a friend who has been having a bad term, and you know why. You can submit with all four names, or email the tutor with a short note about who did what. The tutor has not asked.",
