        "inference": "Read whole, MN 10 is not a relaxation script. It is a map of four fields held together by one doctrinal refrain, ending in a claim about how long the path takes. The breathing exercise is the doorway, not the whole house. The charnel-ground section is doing the work of impermanence, and it is meant to be uncomfortable. If the text feels like a list of techniques, the refrain is the part you skipped.",
