        "context": "SN 12.2 gives the twelve links and defines each one. DN 15 takes the same chain and turns it into a dialogue: for each link, it asks whether there is a specific condition, answers with the previous link, and then asks what would follow if that condition were absent. One text is a glossary; the other is an argument. Comparing them shows how much work genre does.",
